    "answer": {
      "short": "$1728$. Correct answer: C.",
      "worked": "The factors of $12$ are $1,2,3,4,6$ and $12$. Pairing these factors gives\n$$\\begin{align*}1\\times2\\times3\\times4\\times6\\times12&=(1\\times12)(2\\times6)(3\\times4)\\\\1\\times2\\times3\\times4\\times6\\times12&=12\\times12\\times12\\\\1\\times2\\times3\\times4\\times6\\times12&=1728.\\end{align*}$$\nCorrect answer: C.",
